------------------------ Description -----------------------
Height: 5' 11" Weight: 185 lbs. Gender: Male	
Eyes:   Blue Hair: Blond,Neat Skin: Pasty
Dominant Hand: Right Quirks: Depressed, Egoist	
Speech style: High-pitched Quotable: Get these spiders off me!
Full Description

Background
Grew up on a farm, encouraged to the service of Sarenrae by the local priest.

Has adventured in service of the church for a year and now is looking to form an adventuring party to hunt through the Vericostial catacombs for undead that have been snatching citizens.
Campaign Logs
